# Name resolution for a GZAC that runs on the host (jdk.net.hosts.file): the
# containers of its stack know the host as host.docker.internal, and that name
# travels in the URLs they hand to GZAC (verzoek objects, objecttypes). macOS
# does not resolve it on the host itself; this file does, for the JDK only.
127.0.0.1 localhost host.docker.internal keycloak.localhost
::1 localhost
